    "3d8fb2e2-f6bc-4ac3-af20-99975bf73e57": {
      "type": "accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "d2c2f4de-2747-44eb-b58c-516a4c68dfc5": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WHERE CAN I BUY KHY?",
            "item_content": "<p>Khy is exclusively sold online at <a>khy.com</a>. </p>"
          }
        },
        "47de8a80-27a0-4d7f-8f65-e3d1d4ecdafb": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WHY DID AN ORDER IN MY CART BECOME UNAVAILABLE DURING CHECKOUT? ",
            "item_content": "<p>Due to the exclusivity of our collections, items in your shopping cart are not reserved. As a result, items in your cart may sell out before you complete your order. <br/><br/>In the event an item is no longer available, you can sign up to receive a back in stock email on the product page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "9533551c-3661-4023-a864-36428aafac43": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WHEN WILL MY ORDER SHIP?",
            "item_content": "<p>Orders are processed as quickly as possible, pending item availability and payment approval. Due to the exclusivity of our collections, we expect high volumes. You will receive an email notifying you of your tracking information when your order has been shipped. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br/><br/>Most orders placed Monday through Friday (excluding holidays) will be processed and shipped within 2-3 business days. Weekend orders will begin processing on Monday.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br/><br/>Certain products may have longer processing times. These will be noted on the product and cart pages.\t</p>"
          }
        },
        "beab6091-c02b-480f-86b2-ec35910efdcd": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "HOW CAN I TRACK MY ORDER?",
            "item_content": "<p>You can track your order with the tracking link provided in your shipment notification email or by logging in to your account on khy.com.\t<br/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br/>Orders containing multiple items may arrive in multiple shipments. \t</p>"
          }
        },
        "4a8609a1-44e6-44ee-aeb0-8239b77d1d60": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WHAT ARE THE PAYMENT OPTIONS?",
            "item_content": "<p>Credit Cards\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br/>We accept Visa, MasterCard, American Express, and Discover cards. Payment is authorized at time of purchase and captured once your order has been shipped.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br/><br/>PayPal\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br/>When selecting this option at checkout, you will be directed to the PayPal site to Log In' and review before clicking 'Pay Now'. Once this transaction is complete, you will then return to khy.com. Please make sure your address in PayPal is up to date. \t\t</p>"
          }
        },
        "4b756eb9-2049-4403-b948-b72c0dadbd0e": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "CAN I MAKE CHANGES TO MY ORDER?",
            "item_content": "<p>Due to the volume of orders, we are unable to make any changes to the items in your order after it has been placed. This includes order modifications, cancellations, and address changes.\t<br/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br/>If you'd like to add another item to your order, please place a new order for the item.\t</p>"
          }
        },
        "4869c122-8c2e-4ce4-aee5-971882ca242b": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "CAN I CANCEL MY ORDER?",
            "item_content": "<p>We are unable to change or cancel an order after you've placed it. If you have placed an order in error, you can return your order once received. <br/><br/>Returns are subject to a return shipping fee, which will be deducted from your refund.</p>"
          }
        },
        "e152fa66-a0fa-4309-b421-0d3c89d96af9": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WHY WAS MY ORDER CANCELED?",
            "item_content": "<p>It is possible that your order may be canceled during high-volume periods due to inventory selling out. If your order is canceled, all charges will be automatically refunded. We recommend signing up for our waitlist for the sold-out item.\t<br/><br/>To ensure your security, we take additional steps in verifying the details of your order. If you receive a cancellation notification, please contact <a href=\"mailto:support@khy.com\" title=\"mailto:support@khy.com\">support@khy.com</a> for more information.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f503486e-dba0-48f1-b4f0-6d5256448d0b": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "CAN I CHANGE MY SHIPPING ADDRESS?",
            "item_content": "<p>Once an order is placed, the shipping address cannot be changed. We will only ship to the shipping address entered when the order was originally placed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "de41a37c-950a-4daa-a200-cfe6a5bd7180": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WHEN WILL YOU RESTOCK?",
            "item_content": "<p>Please click \"Join the Waitlist\" to receive a notification when a product is back in stock. <br/><br/>You may also sign up for email notifications and/or text messages to be notified of any restocks or new product launches.\t</p>"
          }
        }
      },
