    "beb051df-70fc-4bc5-9f2d-564126a66f48": {
      "type": "accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "78a71bd6-521a-4203-bdd7-615334da8250": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WHAT IS YOUR RETURN POLICY?",
            "item_content": "<p>If you don't love your purchase, you may return it for a refund. Returns must be requested within 14 days of the date of delivery. Domestic returns are subject to an $8 return shipping fee, which will be deducted from your refund.<br/><br/>International return shipping fees vary by location.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br/><br/>Products must be returned unworn, unwashed, in their original condition, and with all tags attached.  We reserve the right to refuse returns that show signs of wear or do not meet the above criteria.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br/><br/>Products marked as \"Final Sale\" are not eligible for return.</p>"
          }
        },
        "ef94574e-87f7-49e2-94aa-21ae68933fa4": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "HOW DO I START A RETURN?",
            "item_content": "<p>Visit our returns page to begin your return: <a href=\"/pages/returns\" title=\"Returns\">khy.com/pages/returns </a>Please reach out to <a href=\"mailto:support@khy.com\" title=\"mailto:support@khy.com\">support@khy.com</a> if you have questions or need assistance with your return.</p>"
          }
        },
        "9b694d36-5f03-46b0-9dc3-b0d81aa93b8c": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "CAN I EXCHANGE MY ITEM?",
            "item_content": "<p>At this time we are unable to offer exchanges. We recommend requesting a return for the item you'd like to return and placing a new order for the new item. Once your return is received at our warehouse and processed, you will receive a refund back to your original payment method. </p>"
          }
        },
        "00c70187-a1ef-4b3c-956e-c6231340850f": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WHERE IS MY RETURN/REFUND?",
            "item_content": "<p>Once your return is received and processed, you will be notified via email. This process can take up to 2 business days from the date your return tracking information shows delivered.<br/><br/>If your return is accepted, your refund will be processed and applied to the original method of payment.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br/><br/>Please note that refunds can take up to 3-5 business days to appear on your bank account due to varying processing times of financial institutions.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
