    "accordion_3MrpmG": {
      "type": "accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_item_GDQYqQ": {
          "type": "accordion-item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How should I store my faux leather pieces?",
            "item_content": "<p>We recommend hanging your new faux leather pieces, as opposed to folding. Faux leather items from the same colorway can be hung together and/or hung alongside any non-leather garments. <strong>However, it's important to avoid hanging any Chalk and Black faux leather pieces together.<br/><br/></strong>When different colors of any faux leather items (yes, even from other brands) are stored together, there is a possibility of a reaction occurring, which may cause the color coating to transfer onto one another. Not to worry—this is standard across the industry, but it does not pose a concern if your items are stored correctly.<br/><br/>Any other questions about how to best care for these items? Don't hesitate to email <a href=\"mailto:support@khy.com\" target=\"_blank\">support@khy.com</a>.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
